  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project 7 of Enhancing Human and Operational Capacities of Somalia&#x2019;s Immigration Authorities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed intervention aims to contribute to achieving Strategic Objective #3 as defined in the IOM Strategic Plan 2019-2021, i.e. advancing well-being of society and migrants through stronger migration governance and development. This project aims to achieve this by continuing to foster an integrated approach that focuses on the active engagement of diasporic actors to transfer knowledge and competencies to the IND. Furthermore, it will contribute to the improvement of the IND Kismayo (Branch 2) through purchasing ICT equipment. It will focus on organizational and human capacity building at the centralized level of the Federal Government of Somalia (FGoS) in Mogadishu and its Regional Branch in Kismayo.</narrative>
  </description>
